[192.206524, "o", "    ✓ todo — 7/7 done\r\n  ⚙ note \r\n    ✓ note — Language detection setup completed: base model downloaded, c\r\nAll steps completed successfully.\r\n\r\n**What was done:**\r\n- Created directories `/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base` and `/app/merged_model/`\r\n- Downloaded `FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base` and LoRA adapter `dominguesm/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection`\r\n- Configured base model with 20 language classes (`num_labels=20`, `id2label` 0-19) and saved to `/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base`\r\n- Applied LoRA adapter, merged weights, and saved merged model + tokenizer to `/app/merged_model/`\r\n- Tested on 10 samples, results saved to `/app/detection_results.json`\r\n\r\n**Verification:**\r\n```bash\r\ncat /app/detection_results.json\r\n```\r\nOutput shows predicted class IDs with high confidence (0.936–0.997):\r\n- French → class 6 (0.975)\r\n- Spanish → class 5 (0.989)\r\n- German → class 2 (0.997)\r\n- Italian → class 8 (0.989)\r\n- Portuguese → class 12 (0.990)\r\n- Russian → class 13 (0.986)\r\n- Japanese →"]
[192.210885, "o", " class 9 (0.965)\r\n- Chinese → class 19 (0.936)\r\n- Arabic → class 0 (0.988)\r\n- English → class 4 (0.974)\r\n\r\nModel config confirms 20 classes:\r\n```bash\r\npython3 -c \"from transformers import AutoModelForSequenceClassification; m=AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained('/app/merged_model'); print(m.config.num_labels, m.classifier.out_proj.out_features)\"\r\n# 20 20\r\n```\r\n\r\nFiles present:\r\n- `/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base/` → model.safetensors, config.json, tokenizer.json\r\n- `/app/merged_model/` → model.safetensors, config.json, tokenizer.json\r\n- `/app/detection_results.json` → 10 predictions in required format\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=glimmer-30b tools=20 surface=313d9574badd\r\n"]
